ENGINEERING DISCLAIMER

PCIS is decision-support software. It does not replace the judgement of a
qualified ventilation engineer or an experienced poultry house operator.

Every equation and constant is cited to a published source, and values that
could not be verified are flagged in the output rather than estimated. The
model has NOT been validated against measurements from a working house.
Recommendations should be treated as engineering guidance to be checked
against observed conditions and the welfare of the birds, not as settings to
be applied unexamined.

Third-party components retain their own licences: PySide6/Qt (LGPLv3),
SQLAlchemy (MIT), ReportLab (BSD).
